'Report counts restated and verified by grep on the finished file: section 6 holds 46 rows, 34 of them carry a datasheet observation and 12 carry engine evidence only. The 34 = 7 AutoNumber Delete rows (no dialog expected, value unchanged), 15 Zoom overlength boxes, 10 rule/required dialogs captured through the datasheet Save Record action (DurationMin, WeightKg, AppointmentFee, Quantity, UnitPriceCharged, ReceiptDate, ReceiptTotal, AppliedAmount, SeverityLevel, AccountType - each stored value read back unchanged), plus tblPet.BirthDate and tblMedication.ListPrice from the pilot. The 12 = the 11 referential-integrity rows plus tblMedicationInteraction.InteractionDescription. AppointmentDate is labelled datasheet plus engine: no dialog, the typed 30/02/2026 was not accepted and the stored date stayed 2026-11-10, which is itself the observation the workbook asks for. PK/FK/12-relationship findings are unchanged from the previous entry.',
